  "notes": "The official GND record identifies Druckerei C. G. Naumann as a Leipzig Company distinct from GND 1072998033, C. G. Naumann Verlag. The exact 1893 title page assigns Druck and Verlag to the literal C. G. Naumann. This provisional role-specific identity asserts neither legal separation nor identity between the two authority records, and it is not a successor claim.",
